WEBVTT

00:12:58.893 --> 00:13:03.432
For a man, that's a risky proposition.

00:13:03.432 --> 00:13:05.673
So as parents and partners,

00:13:05.673 --> 00:13:08.860
we should be socializing our sons

00:13:08.860 --> 00:13:11.311
and our husbands

00:13:11.311 --> 00:13:14.635
to be whatever they want to be,

00:13:14.635 --> 00:13:18.254
either caregivers or breadwinners.

00:13:18.254 --> 00:13:21.610
We should be socializing them to make caregiving

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:23.597
cool for guys.

00:13:23.597 --> 00:13:27.362
(Applause)

00:13:27.362 --> 00:13:33.674
I can almost hear lots of you thinking, "No way."